        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tThree-bedroom mid-terrace family home\r\n•\tGas fire central heating\r\n•\tSpacious and well-proportioned accommodation\r\n•\tRear garage with valuable laneway access\r\n•\tPrivate rear garden\r\n•\tIdeal first-time buyer or family home\r\n•\tMature and highly convenient residential location\r\n•\tNo onward chain."
